  "details": "Whenever I take a screenshot I freeze for 2-6 seconds. I have no idea the cause, but in other games it works fine even at higher supersampled resolutions. I'm on oculus rift if it helps to know. Long ago it didn't do this, so I don't know if it's something that steam changed, or vrchat, or maybe it's something about my computer in particular. Either way, I just want a solution and I'm not too sure where else to mention it as I'm not sure it's VRChat's fault, but then again it only happens in VRChat so it likely is. \n\n\nHere is an example of me taking two screenshots that I identify using my hand https://streamable.com/rnkku",
